# Robotaxi Escape (run escape; data run.escape): standing still at the Valencia shops, by the street.
# The robotaxi starts on the street 70 m behind you, drives up (within 15 m: escapeClose and a polite
# honk), stops 2 m short, and once it has been within 3 m of you (its body's outline) for 2 s you
# are pulled over: escapeOver, not survived, no score.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 run escape
run 1600
expect event escapeStart{seconds=90,car=83} within 2..2
expect event escapeClose{dist=14.96} within 941..941
expect event honk{car=83,robo=true} within 941..941
expect event escapeOver{survived=false,score=0} within 1439..1439
expect event escapeOver count == 1
expect session.mode == over at end
expect max car.car.speed <= 8.5 over 2..1600
